--- text
<time> INFO server started port=8080 debug=false
<time> WARN disk low free=0.5 path="/var/data dir" note="say \"hi\"" empty="" eq="a=b"
<time> ERROR two\nlines list="[1, \"a b\"]" map="{\"k\": 1}" none=none
<time> INFO no fields
--- levels
<time> DEBUG shown at debug
<time> ERROR shown at error
--- child loggers
<time> INFO handled request_id=r1 status=200
<time> WARN slow request_id=r2 user=ana ms=950
<time> INFO root has no fields
--- json
{"time": "<time>", "level": "info", "msg": "started", "port": 8080, "tags": ["a"]}
{"time": "<time>", "level": "error", "msg": "a field named msg replaces the message", "request_id": "r1"}
--- errors
log: the level must be debug, info, warn, error or off, not loud
log: the level must be debug, info, warn, error or off, not 3
log: the format must be text or json, not xml
--- LOG_LEVEL and stderr
stdout ok true true
stdout ok true
